#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "Sinopsis"

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdeinit4</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">--help</arg> <group> <arg>--"
"no-fork</arg> <arg>--no-kded</arg> <arg>--suicide</arg> </group> <group> "
"<arg>+programs</arg> <arg>programs</arg> </group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kdeinit4</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">--help</arg> <group> <arg>--"
"no-fork</arg> <arg>--no-kded</arg> <arg>--suicide</arg> </group> <group> "
"<arg>+programs</arg> <arg>programs</arg> </group>"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"kdeinit4 is a process launcher somewhat similar to the famous <command>init</"
"command> used for booting UNIX. It executes &kde; programs and kdeinit "
"loadable modules (KLMs) starting them more efficiently."
msgstr ""
"kdeinit4 je proces za pokretanje donekle sličan poznatom<command>init</"
"command>koji se koristi za pokretanja UNIX. To izvršava &kde; programe i  "
"kdeinit loadable modules (KLMs) pokrećući ih mnogo efikasnije."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using kdeinit4 to launch &kde; applications makes starting a typical &kde; "
"application a couple times faster and reduces memory consumption by a "
"substantial amount."
msgstr ""
"Korištenje kdeinit4 za pokretanje &kde; aplikacija čini pokretanje tipičnih "
"&kde; aplikacija par puta brže i smanjuje potrošnje memorije za znatan iznos."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"kdeinit4 is linked against all libraries a standard &kde; application needs. "
"With this technique, starting an application becomes much faster because now "
"only the application itself needs to be linked whereas otherwise both the "
"application as well as all the libaries it uses need to be linked."
msgstr ""
"kdeinit4 je povezan sa svim bibliotekama koje treba  standardna &kde; "
"aplikacija. Uz ovu tehniku, pokretanje aplikacija postaje mnogo brže jer "
"sada samo same aplikacije treba da budu povezane, dok u suprotnom kako u "
"primjeni, kao i sve biblioteke da bi se mogle  koristi moraju biti povezani."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disadvantages"
msgstr "Nedostaci"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The process name of applications started via kdeinit4 is \"kdeinit4\". This "
"problem can be corrected to a degree by changing the application name as "
"shown by <command>ps</command>. However, applications like <command>killall</"
"command> will only see kdeinit4 as the process name. To workaround this, use "
"<command>kdekillall</command> (from kdesdk/scripts) for applications started "
"via kdeinit4."
msgstr ""
"Ime proces aplikacija počelo preko kdeinit4 je\"kdeinit4\". Ovaj problem se "
"može ispraviti u mjeri promjenom imena aplikacije kao što je prikazano od "
"strane  <command>ps</command>. Međutim, kao što su aplikacije "
"<command>killall</command> će vidjeti samo kdeinit4 kao ime procesa. "
"Zaobilaznim putem, koristite <command>kdekillall</command>(od kdesdk/"
"scripts) za aplikacije koje  se pocinju koristiti  preko kdeinit4."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcije"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "--help"
msgstr "--help"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show help about options"
msgstr "Pokaži pomoć o opcijama"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "--no-fork"
msgstr "--no-fork"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not fork, i.e. do not exit until all the executed programs ends"
msgstr ""
"Ne razgranavajte, odnosno ne izlazite sve dok se svi programi koji se "
"izvrsavaju ne zavrse."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "--no-kded"
msgstr "--no-kded"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not start kded"
msgstr "Nemoj pokretati kded"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "--suicide"
msgstr "--suicide"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Terminate when no KDE applications are left running"
msgstr "Završite kada nije ostalo KDE aplikacija koje se izvrsavaju"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "+programs"
msgstr "+programi"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "runs the programs handling requests"
msgstr "pokrece programe i rjesava po zahtjevima"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "programs"
msgstr "programi"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "runs the programs without handling requests"
msgstr "pokrece programe i rjesava ih bez gledanja redoslijeda zahtjeva"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Upotreba"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A standard way to run this program is by simply specifying the following "
"command at the prompt <userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> program</"
"userinput> or <userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> +program </userinput>"
msgstr ""
"A standardni način za pokretanje ovog programa je jednostavno navodeći "
"sljedeće naredbe na upitu <userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> program</"
"userinput> or <userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> +program </userinput>"

